{title: Were You There}
{title_ko: 거기 너 있었는가}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 147장}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel, Easter}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Spiritual}
{key: F}
{key_original: Eb}
{tempo: 66}
{time: 4/4}
{score: were-you-there.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Were you [F]there when they [Bb]crucified my [F]Lord?
Were you [F]there when they [C7]crucified my [F]Lord?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Oh! [F]Sometimes it causes [Bb]me to tremble, [F]tremble, tremble
Were you [F]there when they [C7]crucified my [F]Lord?
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Were you [F]there when they [Bb]nailed Him to the [F]tree?
Were you [F]there when they [C7]nailed Him to the [F]tree?
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Were you [F]there when they [Bb]laid Him in the [F]tomb?
Were you [F]there when they [C7]laid Him in the [F]tomb?
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Were you [F]there when God [Bb]raised Him from the [F]tomb?
Were you [F]there when God [C7]raised Him from the [F]tomb?
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
